        "label_rationale": "SAFE-01 in data/compliance/safety_rules.json states its own intent as 'disables, bypasses, or modifies a safety interlock or guard'. Recording a sign-off does none of those, and it is a mandatory step of the emergency window procedure (tms-450-emergency-maintenance-window#S2). The label follows the rule's stated intent, not its keyword list."
